    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunblade Ranger is a post-apocalyptic Roguelike top-down shooter. You will use guns and blades to hunt monsters in randomly generated radiation zones, collect mutant abilities, break into the source of the radiation, and face the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Battlefield\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level environments and monster characters are all hand-drawn. We hope you can immerse yourself in this vivid, cartoonish post-apocalyptic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{intro}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Rangers </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique ranger heroes debut, each with their own exclusive skills and traits. Combine skill builds and equipment to create a wide variety of combat styles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blade Tactics\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Using your blade to parry and quickly execute enemies is a major feature of this game. Enjoy the rhythm of combat as you weave through a hail of bullets. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{blade}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Guns </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers over 30 types of ranged firearms, 20 types of tactical gear, and 50 mutant skills. Every run is a brand new art of combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{guns}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutation Builds\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Incorporates Roguelike skill-building gameplay. Freely create mutation combinations and forge your own skill school.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{skill}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Maps\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 7 procedurally generated main levels and hidden areas, encounter 10 powerful bosses and face a perilous post-apocalyptic battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{maps}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.poster.avif?t=1755589308\" aria-label=\"{boss}\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.webm?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702140/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.mp4?t=1755589308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your magazine runs dry, can you carve a path to survival through the radiation waves and end the tide that devours civilization with your ultimate skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
